              (KS3), 2026-11-27: good.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on three recordings (a journey, a life cycle with
              deaths and restarts, and the Bishop's cave): every hook event
              against the original, with negative controls

  Hardware    ZX Spectrum Next (Kickstarter 3), System/Next 26.11a: played by
              the owner, good (earlier: Tang Nano 20K FPGA build of the Next:
              loads with DivMMC automap on and plays)

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
